# Privacy Policy for ParkVision — Apple TV

**Last Updated:** March 16, 2026

## Overview

ParkVision ("the App") is a 3D sliding-block puzzle game available on Apple TV (tvOS). We are committed to protecting your privacy and being transparent about how we handle your data.

## Data Collection

ParkVision does **not** collect, store, or transmit any user data to our servers. We have no servers, no databases, and no access to your information.

### We Do NOT Collect
- Personal identification information
- Location data
- Usage analytics or tracking
- Advertising identifiers
- Any data whatsoever

## Data Storage

All your data remains under your control:
1. **Locally** on your Apple TV
2. **In your private iCloud account** (if iCloud is enabled)

We have **zero access** to your data. Apple's iCloud infrastructure ensures your data remains private and encrypted.

## In-App Purchases

ParkVision offers optional in-app purchases (Solution Credits) through Apple's StoreKit. All payment processing is handled entirely by Apple. We do not receive, store, or have access to any payment information. Apple's privacy policy applies: [apple.com/privacy](https://www.apple.com/privacy/)

## Third-Party Services

ParkVision does **not** integrate any third-party SDKs, analytics, advertising frameworks, or tracking services. The App uses only Apple first-party frameworks.

### iCloud
If enabled, your data syncs via Apple's iCloud across all your Apple devices, including Apple TV. Apple's privacy policy applies: [apple.com/privacy](https://www.apple.com/privacy/)

## Data Sharing

We do **not**:
- Sell your data
- Share your data with third parties
- Use your data for advertising
- Track your behavior

## Children's Privacy

ParkVision does not knowingly collect data from children under 13.

## Your Rights

You can:
- **Delete your data** by removing the app from your Apple TV (local data) and disabling iCloud sync
- **Disable sync** by turning off iCloud for the app in your Apple TV Settings

## Changes to This Policy

We may update this policy. Continued use of the app after changes constitutes acceptance.

